<!-- Dark variant («ночная панель», X Dim): same geometry as the light pictogram, hardcoded dark palette. The provider picks the variant in code — RemoteViews are inflated by the launcher under the SYSTEM configuration, so resource qualifiers cannot follow the app theme mode. -->
<!-- Widget pictogram, ON: the app launcher icon itself
     (ic_launcher_foreground geometry), reframed so the plate
     fills the viewport — the widget IS the icon, per the user's
     spec (mockup approved 2026-11-15): orange ON zone on the
     left, black slider on the right, orange rivet. -->
